# ============================================================
#  HOW TO GET YOUR ANTHROPIC API KEY
# ============================================================
#  1. Go to https://console.anthropic.com
#  2. Sign up or log in
#  3. Click "API Keys" in the left sidebar
#  4. Click "Create Key" → give it a name → copy the key
#  5. Paste it below (replace the placeholder)
#  6. Rename this file from ".env.local.example" to ".env.local"
#
#  IMPORTANT RULES:
#  - NEVER share this key with anyone
#  - NEVER commit .env.local to GitHub (it's already in .gitignore)
#  - If you accidentally expose it, go to console.anthropic.com
#    and delete + regenerate the key immediately
# ============================================================

GROQ_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
